{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-homework#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-homework","commit":"588019205d2043569603eb526c4c31467730c387","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-homework（DSH 插件，通用客户端）：为家长和学生按年级或学习困难生成作业辅导建议。它向 DSH 注册 homework 工具，接收年级或“拖延”“偏科”等场景参数，并返回学习计划、提示和辅导原则。方案覆盖小学低年级、小学高年级、初中、拖延及偏科，适合希望获得亲子作业指导思路的家庭。代码未配置外部服务或密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:6-13","lib/index.js:14-22"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-homework#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-homework","commit":"588019205d2043569603eb526c4c31467730c387","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-homework is a DSH tool for any client. It returns a homework plan and guidance for primary or middle school, procrastination, or uneven subject performance. Unknown grades use the lower-primary plan. No external service or API key is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:6-13","lib/index.js:14-22"]}
